# bastion - sshd, BASELINE profile: close to a default installation.
# Passwords accepted, root may log in, no restriction on relaying.

Port 22
AddressFamily inet
PermitRootLogin yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM no
MaxAuthTries 6
MaxStartups 100:30:200
AllowTcpForwarding yes
X11Forwarding yes
LogLevel INFO
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
